WEBVTT

00:05:57.395 --> 00:06:00.940
Yes, so I really love to get good sleep.

00:06:00.981 --> 00:06:04.110
And literally everyone here
at home knows that.

00:06:04.527 --> 00:06:07.905
And also, I love getting involved
in church activities.

00:06:08.489 --> 00:06:09.698
Yes.

00:06:09.698 --> 00:06:12.493
MR: I know you've talked about

00:06:12.493 --> 00:06:17.415
capitalism as being part of a problem
in degrading land

00:06:17.456 --> 00:06:21.544
and extracting and degrading, etc.

00:06:21.544 --> 00:06:24.505
What kind of structures would you
like to see in a broad sense?

00:06:24.547 --> 00:06:26.841
What kind of world would you like to see?

00:06:26.882 --> 00:06:31.846
VN: Yes, I would like to see
a kind of world that respects people,